  "text": "[NDBG.22.3.1] If a follower tier does not reach its pause point\nwithin a configurable timeout (default 5 s), the leader emits a\n`ds/tierPauseTimeout` event and the IDE marks the follower as\n`\"unresponsive\"`. The leader's pause state is not affected.\n\n",
